{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんこんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暖色を着たい気温"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、元気に過ごしてますでしょうか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゴールデンウィークですね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どこか出かけてる方、お家にいる方"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事されてる方もいらっしゃるのかなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもおつかれさまです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "休める時に休んでね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はいつでも隣にいます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お出かけするなら藤の花見に行きたいなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きなお花TOP4に入るくらい大好きなんです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも私のことだからどこの藤の花を見にいくか迷って時間が経って、結局お家にいそう(笑)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「B.L.T.」さん　6月号に掲載していただいています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な空間で、楽しく撮っていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現在発売中です！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ見ていただけると嬉しいです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちらはオフショット"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん撮っていただいたのでたくさん載せちゃう＾＾"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobx2uwjS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobHlkL90.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/moblID5SJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobLi7v4Y.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobJCLgui.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}